# 11. RESPONSIVE AND INPUT SUPPORT

Desktop keyboard controls are the priority.

Also support:

- Browser window resizing.
- Appropriate UI scaling.
- Pointer focus management.
- Fullscreen mode where supported.
- Touch control buttons on smaller screens.

Do not allow accidental browser scrolling or keyboard events to interfere with gameplay.

Show a useful loading screen while 3D assets load.

Handle missing assets gracefully.

